(6885854, 1037137, 138630, '<td valign="top">My top pick.  This is superb.  I love the way the two rocks are eying one another, the way the man is looking at the woman and his rock is pulling at the leash, the fact that the woman is walking away but her rock is lagging behind.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'My top pick.  This is superb.  I love the way the two rocks are eying one another, the way the man is looking at the woman and his rock is pulling at the leash, the fact that the woman is walking away but her rock is lagging behind.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-18 22:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885857, 1037168, 138630, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and nicely done.  I love the colors here, the feel of a spring day and perfect chair-flying weather.</td>', 'Clever idea and nicely done.  I love the colors here, the feel of a spring day and perfect chair-flying weather.', '2012-10-18 22:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885858, 1037061, 138630, '<td valign="top">One of my top four - clever idea, well executed.  I love that the lamp is lit.  Must be a nice night.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'One of my top four - clever idea, well executed.  I love that the lamp is lit.  Must be a nice night.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-18 22:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885859, 1037197, 138630, '<td valign="top">Top four for me - I like the tension and the focus, squarely on the obstinate pet insect!  Well done.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Top four for me - I like the tension and the focus, squarely on the obstinate pet insect!  Well done.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-18 22:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6885862, 1037199, 138630, '<td valign="top">Found, I assume, and nice for the challenge.  Probably will get some DNMC votes, but it''s in my top 10.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Found, I assume, and nice for the challenge.  Probably will get some DNMC votes, but it''s in my top 10.  Voted earlier.', '2012-10-18 22:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
