(6886176, 1037168, 138630, '<td valign="top">Delightfully fresh and quirky - I think you made the balloon strings part harder than it had to be but it sounds as if you got up close and personal with the selection tools and there''s always something to be gained from really getting to know a tool :)  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Delightfully fresh and quirky - I think you made the balloon strings part harder than it had to be but it sounds as if you got up close and personal with the selection tools and there''s always something to be gained from really getting to know a tool :)  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2012-10-19 11:02:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6886182, 1037197, 138630, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the HM, Chris - thought this would end up near the top.  I didn''t mind the soft focus on the butt since the head is sharp but I can see where it would have improved the shot slightly, but the idea (as everyone has said) did not suffer for the softness.  They say people pick pets that look like them - or is it the pets that pick their people :)</td>', 'Congratulations on the HM, Chris - thought this would end up near the top.  I didn''t mind the soft focus on the butt since the head is sharp but I can see where it would have improved the shot slightly, but the idea (as everyone has said) did not suffer for the softness.  They say people pick pets that look like them - or is it the pets that pick their people :)', '2012-10-19 11:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
